<title>USA: San Jose FA, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>San Jose FA, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica said it won $6.935 million of San Jose Financing Authority, Calif., 1997 lease revenue bonds, Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.59 percent.</p>
</text>
